dump           equil_dump  all  custom  100  /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/MHI_Nickel/tests/pipeline/work/diffusivity/results/ni_bulk_test_3H/results/700K/nvt_700K_phase1_equil.lammpstrj  id type x y z
dump_modify    equil_dump  sort id

compute        msd_H      H_atom  msd
fix            msd_equil  all  ave/time  1  1  100                c_msd_H[4]  file  /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/MHI_Nickel/tests/pipeline/work/diffusivity/results/ni_bulk_test_3H/results/700K/msd_700K_equil.dat  mode scalar

print "### Phase 1: Equilibration 0 ps at 700 K ###"
